BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (configured timeout; the caller retries the complete request with the same event key. Never retry only the posting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (portion. Every state-changing request contains a stable source identifier, external event identifier, and canonical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (payload. Identical replays return the original event; a reused identifier with different contents raises an error. State) Tj ET
