BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (the database check-then-write race. The reference deliberately sends no external wires, deeds, or messages. Escrow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (performs those actions through its established controls; this application records confirmed results. Consequently, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (timeout cannot issue a second payment. Multi-host deployment requires a server database and equivalent transaction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (semantics rather than a shared network-mounted SQLite file.) Tj ET
