BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (names a reviewer, document location, digest, verdict, and expiration time. The latest review for each required category) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (controls advancement; a failed replacement blocks the next transition even if an earlier review passed. The code) Tj ET
