BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (metadata, not authentication credentials, and the program does not independently fetch or interpret the referenced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (documents. The screening score merely orders work: documented access, plausible zoning fit, closed comparable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (coverage, and environmental screening contribute explicit points. A high score cannot substitute for the later evidence) Tj ET
