BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (subsequent buyer package cannot silently drop an inconvenient constraint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (The journal recognizes acquisition as inventory against cash, not immediate loss. A completed sale records gross) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (proceeds as revenue, releases the parcel's actual inventory basis into cost of goods sold, and expenses settlement) Tj ET
