BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (2. Turn six plays into a paid-enrichment waterfall) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (operating_framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 671.55 Tm (Map the six plays to distinct evidence requirements instead of using one universal land score. Rural discount resales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 656.32 Tm (need credible access and sales evidence for genuinely comparable acreage. Infill builder lots need jurisdiction,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 641.10 Tm (setbacks, utility serviceability, and a plausible building envelope. Tax-delinquent owner purchases need current) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 625.87 Tm (balances and owner authority; they are negotiated acquisitions, not an assumption that a tax lien conveys ownership.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 610.65 Tm (Estate-owned acquisitions require the correct representative and transaction authority, not merely a deceased name on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 595.42 Tm (an assessor record. Access-and-title cures require a documented, executable cure whose cost and counterparties are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 580.20 Tm (understood before relying on improved resale value. Minor subdivisions require local division rules, state definitions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 564.97 Tm (survey work, service constraints, and recordable results. Arizona's subdivision definitions in A.R.S. 32-2101 illustrate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 549.75 Tm (why a desk cannot treat a locally labeled minor division as automatically outside every state requirement. Assign one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 534.52 Tm (primary play to each candidate, with secondary opportunities recorded separately. This makes rejection reasons) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 519.30 Tm (measurable. An inaccessible rural tract must not quietly become an access-cure opportunity unless the principal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 504.07 Tm (approves a new evidence budget and a specific cure path. Otherwise automation simply relabels risk until every parcel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 488.85 Tm (appears investable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 473.62 Tm (Run enrichment from cheapest disqualifier to most expensive confirmation. Stage one uses an authorized county extract) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 458.40 Tm (to remove duplicates, unsuitable acreage, obvious jurisdiction mismatches, and retired parcel identifiers. Stage two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 443.17 Tm (joins public hazard layers, tax records, and recorded subdivision references. Stage three buys commercial transaction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 427.95 Tm (attributes only for surviving parcels, then checks the underlying sales against deed type, parcel count, improvement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 412.72 Tm (status, and transfer context. Stage four commissions the targeted title, survey, civil, or environmental work needed by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.50 Tm (the actual play. For an illustrative processing batch, 5,000 source parcels might become 600 geographic matches, 120) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.27 Tm (desktop survivors, 30 paid enrichments, and six document-intensive reviews. Those counts describe workload, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.05 Tm (expected closings or a replacement revenue forecast. Set a maximum purchased-data cost per reviewed candidate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.82 Tm (before releasing the batch. If a commercial source returns a bundled sale of ten parcels, do not assign its entire) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.60 Tm (consideration to each component. If consideration is missing or protected by local disclosure practice, retain the sale as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 321.37 Tm (unpriced evidence and seek another supported comparable. The waterfall saves money by preserving uncertainty rather) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.15 Tm (than manufacturing a price from incomplete fields.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.92 Tm (Keep the four-person pod small by assigning decisions as carefully as tasks. The full-time principal sets buying criteria,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.70 Tm (negotiates, allocates capital, and approves releases of funds. Contractor one handles GIS, source ingestion, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 260.47 Tm (comparable packets. Contractor two coordinates licensed survey and civil investigations within the qualifications) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 245.25 Tm (actually held, arranging additional specialist services only when required. Contractor three provides title and closing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 230.02 Tm (coordination through properly qualified providers. Do not count a data subscription as a person or describe the pod as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.80 Tm (able to perform every regulated service internally. Escalated professional services are purchased transaction costs, with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.57 Tm (scope and price approved before ordering. At the canonical Conservative and Base levels, staffing remains 1 FT + 3 C;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 184.35 Tm (Scaled uses 2 FT + 4 C. Size each review queue to available decision hours rather than accumulating thousands of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.12 Tm (unresolved leads. Give each exception an owner, next evidence request, due date, and spending ceiling. A weekly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.90 Tm (twenty-minute exception meeting should decide whether to reject, investigate, or negotiate a conditional acquisition. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.67 Tm (should not become a tour of maps. The operational advantage is fewer unsupported commitments per completed deal,) Tj ET
